/*
 * Tree files support.
 *
 * An export with the treefiles option stores its data in a tree of
 * directories below the exportname (which is a directory in this case).
 * Every leaf file in the tree holds exactly one TREEPAGESIZE block of
 * the export; every directory holds at most TREEDIRSIZE files or
 * subdirectories, so larger exports get extra levels of nesting. The
 * block at offset B*TREEPAGESIZE of the export is stored in the file
